{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>蘇黎世保險(香港)懷疑發生資料外洩，暫未知涉及人數。</p><p></p><p>蘇黎世保險(香港)向客戶通報，指周二偵測到懷疑被黑客入侵。初步調查顯示，有客戶個人資料，包括姓名、身份證號碼、保單資料等或被未經授權存取。</p><p></p><p>暫無證據顯示涉及銀行戶口、信用卡等，已暫時停用相關網上平台，並通知受影響客戶。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:16:18.410297+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:13.309871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:30.849578+00:00","content_hash":"f37caf36ebfd26c932536e469ebee8498e1b4b7064cef401941d8f013f1cdc41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:16:18.410297+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}